/* Grading discipline (Aug 2026 research base): values[0] is Polaris; values[1..14]
   map to COMP.brands in order. "y" = established from the vendor's own published
   documents. "p" = partial, and every "p" carries a reason in WHYP below.
   A dash ("n") means we could not establish the capability from the vendor's own
   documents - it does not mean the vendor lacks it. */
